+  "verifiedBy": "subagent:ab293c630a2c6d8f1 — independently re-derived all 111 rows from raw snapshots; F2 max BA 0.551 (no threshold reaches 0.80 in either direction); partition honest (65 FAIL all real BLOCK_TOPOLOGY_CONVERGENCE/FAIL_CORE_INVARIANT); 22 INVALID legitimately excluded; no new gates. Verdict sound."
+}
